  /// Extracts a ticket/issue key hint from tool call args — Java
  /// `JobJavaScriptBridge.extractKeyHint` parity (dm.ai #577): the first
  /// present of `key`, `ticketKey`, `ticket`, `issueKey`, `id`, used for
